.SH NAME
HTMLTextAreaElement.select \- HTMLTextAreaElement: select() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]select()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]HTMLTextAreaElement\f[R] interface selects all the text in a
\f[CR]<textarea>\f[R] element.
.PP
For general information about this method, see
\f[CR]HTMLInputElement.select()\f[R].
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
select()
.EE
.SS Parameters
None.
.SS Return value
None (\f[CR]undefined\f[R]).
